Package: survkit
Title: Survival Curves with Integrated Risk Tables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Evelyn", "Tadlock", , "tadlock.ds@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Publication-ready survival curves with integrated risk tables for both Kaplan-Meier and Cox-adjusted analyses. Provides a unified interface that combines the flexibility of ggadjustedcurves with survminer-style risk tables, censor marks, and confidence intervals.
